{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_06_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_06","title":"厌食","storyCode":"SV-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"3ef6565f5aeef84d1de2864984221939a77f4edf51f3db83a4d1b5f875e59339","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对象是人的话，力道和角度很难控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅了嗅自己）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不流血了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们为什么还这么兴奋？这里的恐鱼本来就这么多吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是昨天那种怪物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前没见过哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天你们不要到这里来了。快回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要拽我的裙子。你不是那么小的小孩子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我是想说......我想好我要什么了。我想听你唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"因为......我不知道什么是歌。我听到你在梦里哼了。但我听不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你答应了？这是不是就是约定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（皱眉）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？是啊，歌手，你的琴去哪里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我回去找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我帮你一起找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这是不是说，你愿意跟我一起回去啦？太、太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的......值得这么高兴？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，墙灰，早上好呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"铁皮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，铁皮去哪里了？你们之前一直形影不离啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"铁皮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你盯着的方向......是海......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，昨天抽到红色贝壳的人，是铁皮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"木框，我的病好像更严重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我的胸口很涨，像是要爆开一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我连东西都不想吃。你不要和我说话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，欢迎再次来到我们家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你奶奶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶还在休息呢。昨天我们一起回到这里，她就一直躺着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，她也消耗了很大体力，肯定很累了。我没想到她会冲出来，对审判官那样说话。她变得和平时都不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的对。她很......厉害。她打退了审判官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"打退了......审判官？！歌手，你这么说，要是让审判官听见，她一定又要生气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随便她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是她想再动手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她不会再来找你麻烦了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......找谁的麻烦都一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸箱子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我们出去找琴吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你头上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！好多绿色的黏黏的东西......这、这是什么东西呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是海藻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是刚才摔跤时候蹭到的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这些......有用吗？看起来和海草长得差不多。能不能等风吹干了拿来铺床？佩特拉奶奶腰不舒服，正好用得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你用贝壳将这些海藻磨碎。不要洗掉这些粘液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上一点海水，记得没过海藻。装进这个小罐子里，封好口。放半年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等罐子里的液体的绿色淡了，说明发酵好了，就可以喝啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？是不是没听明白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你好像从来没一口气对我说过这么多话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝壳也不用扔，洗净晒干，当喝酒的容器用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"酒？那是什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里写着。这里原先是所酒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"原来这个字是酒的意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说喝酒能带来快乐，忘记烦恼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，味道还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前经常喝这个吗？在你的家乡......阿戈尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不大一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有时候会一起喝类似的，在跳舞之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你们那时候一定很快乐。噢，我明白啦！不是酒能带来快乐，是快乐的时候，我们喝酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在外面的人，呃，是不是都会喝酒？大家是不是都很快乐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了。那他们一定没有我现在这么快乐。歌手，谢谢你教我做这个酒。我真想马上就和你一起喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手势错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么碾的话，很难碾碎。你可以换个角度，用最尖的部分对准海藻的纹理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌握韵律，调整呼吸......令你的手，你的身体，与触到你肌肤的海风融为一体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像这样——一击，即碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你盯着我，是还想动手吗？只有你一个人的话，结束得很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"不......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，还给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"是铁皮捡到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"他昨天夜里看到你把这东西掉在了外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，太好了！歌手，我们不用去找琴了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"铁皮他，他把这东西偷偷拿回了我们住的房子，让我......让我把它给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"说完这个他就走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拨琴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这个调子......咦，是你晚上睡着时候哼着的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它经常在我脑子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你和你的同伴，你们以前会唱的歌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在家的时候，这样的歌还有很多。我们用歌声......对彼此说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开以后，其他歌声都消失了。我一个人，只剩下这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪，这首歌听起来很让人难过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拨琴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，我们的约定！你拿回了琴，是不是可以为我们唱歌了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可都等着哩，是吧，佩特拉奶奶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶今天说不出话了。不然她一定也想跟着唱哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，佩特拉奶奶想听呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_05"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个猎人他走上海岸♪\n他的家乡在后，他的路在身前♪\n父母与儿女都与他失散♪\n他的恋人已经葬身大海♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情有一丝变化。你是否感受到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"并不意外，你的神经依旧迟钝。看看你面前的这些水。水位的起伏，波纹的频率，光泽的跃动。这些都是讯息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"快要涨潮了。我们该上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_05"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个猎人他走上海岸♪\n他的家乡在后，徒余哀叹♪\n他的路没有尽头♪\n他的路浓雾弥漫♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"她在唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"她竟然，在这个破房子里，在这些人面前唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人......他们也竟然在听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"低着头的人依然低着头。不会说话的人依然冻着舌头。歌声明明没法进到他们僵硬的躯壳里。可他们的眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"他们，听懂了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她......睡着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我很少见她睡得这么安稳。以前她一闭眼就会大叫，在空气里乱抓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为听见你唱歌，她会想要跳舞。她总是嚷嚷着想跳舞哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"墙灰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我要死了。我的眼睛......进了海水。好咸，一点都不好喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，你这是......你是不是哭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"哭？什么是哭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是从你身体深处流淌出来的情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"这样......吗？我还是不大明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，我喜欢你的歌。你不爱说话，可是你的歌里有许多话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你愿意再唱一遍吗？我想听你说更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拨琴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"有吃的到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"去海滩上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"教士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
